{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "102", "sample_idx": 24, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "\"Oh, darling, you look... comfortable,\" Seraphina said, adjusting the train of her shimmering emerald gown. Her voice was a melodious chime.\n\nLeo shrugged, pulling his sweatpants higher. \"And you look like you're about to float away. Ready for the Gala?\"\n\n\"Ready as I'll ever be. Though I do wish you'd consider something... less… athletic. It’s the annual Charity Ball, Leo, not a marathon.\" Seraphina sighed dramatically.\n\n\"Look, I’m comfortable. It’s a long night, lots of mingling. I’ll be fine. Besides, I’m more worried about navigating the buffet table in these things. Speaking of which, did you hear they're having caviar?\"\n\n\"Caviar is hardly the point! It’s about making an impression, supporting the arts… and looking the part.\" Seraphina smoothed down her skirt. \"Honestly, sometimes I think you deliberately try to underdress.\"\n\n\"Deliberately? No. Efficiently? Absolutely. I'm conserving energy for all the small talk.\" Leo grinned. \"So, what's the agenda? Dance? Donate? Pretend to understand abstract art?\"\n\n\"All of the above, darling. And there's a silent auction. I'm hoping to snag that sculpture.\" Seraphina paused, looking at Leo with a mixture of amusement and exasperation. \"Just... try not to spill anything on your sweats, alright?\"\n\n\"No promises. But I'll try to be a dignified sweat-covered presence.\" Leo chuckled, heading for the door. \"See you there. Don’t let the champagne go to your head.\"\n\n* He's going to be complaining about the buffet the entire evening.\n* I really need to remember to smile and nod a lot.\n* I hope that sculpture isn’t too expensive.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "\"", "logprob": -0.06885108351707458}, {"token": "Oh", "logprob": -0.20756588876247406}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.1734156757593155}, {"token": "▁darling", "logprob": -0.052139732986688614}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.0